            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LoveToCookFL"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I served in a pitcher liquid style with a block of ice in the center. Therefore the last of it was a bit watered down. Very good. Serve cold and in a cold glass if you can. I had to label it and say it was an adult beverage because kids thought it was Kool Aid! The Martha Stewart scrapbook labels available at Walmart, Michaels, etc. are really cute for labeling pitchers and platters at parties.",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-12T06:00:37.663Z"
